OL,3,GNEWSAHow will Bath's new parking
OL,4,Acharges impact you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew parking measures, including charges
OL,7,Fbased on vehicle size, will come into
OL,8,Fforce in Bath on Tuesday.
OL,10,FBath and North East Somerset Council
OL,11,F(Banes) began considering the changes
OL,12,Fin May and said they will now be
OL,13,Fimplemented following public
OL,14,Fconsultation and feedback from
OL,15,Fresidents.
OL,17,FThe council said it hoped that higher
OL,18,Fcosts for larger vehicles would
OL,19,Fencourage people to use public
OL,20,Ftransport or opt for smaller cars with
OL,21,Flower emissions.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
