OL,3,GNEWSAHow will Bath's new parking
OL,4,Acharges impact you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the new rules for larger
OL,7,Fvehicles are just one of the changes
OL,8,Fbeing introduced, so here is all you
OL,9,Fneed to know about the new measures.
